flowchart TB
  subgraph Incoming[真实平台入站，已核验 UID]
    DM[DM 来信]
    PUB[公开评论 / 入站 @]
  end
  GATE[SocialPolicyGate.actor + 好友名册 + 当前账号]
  PORTRAIT[SocialPortraitGateway.observe
有限明确偏好与边界 / 180 天]
  STORE[(accountRuntimeDir/social-portrait/evidence-v1.json)]
  ASSEMBLER[SocialContextAssembler.getPortrait
DM 私密+公开 / 公开只读公开]
  MODEL[InteractionBatcher + 唯一 Life Voice
SocialAutonomyDecisionContract]
  P6DM[DM P6 预约 + 到期领取]
  P6PUB[评论 / @ P6 预约 + 到期领取]
  BOUNDARY[SocialPortraitGateway.continuationAllowed
可撤回边界，读取失败拒绝延期]
  SEND[原 SocialPolicyGate / Rhythm / 额度 / 去重
平台核验回执 / 不确定不重发]
  DM --> GATE
  PUB --> GATE
  GATE -->|仅列名好友明确自述| PORTRAIT
  PORTRAIT <--> STORE
  STORE --> ASSEMBLER
  ASSEMBLER --> MODEL
  MODEL --> P6DM
  MODEL --> P6PUB
  P6DM -->|预约前 + 到期前| BOUNDARY
  P6PUB -->|预约前 + 到期前| BOUNDARY
  STORE --> BOUNDARY
  BOUNDARY -->|仅允许继续考虑，不授予发送权| SEND
  MODEL -->|正常新来信回复，仍须许可| SEND
  subgraph Curiosity[同一 LifeInterests，非新人格 / 不产生社交外发]
    WATCH[真实 selected watch + 合法 BV]
    STATE[(stateDir/life-memory/interests.json
entries + curiosityCandidates + curiosityDismissed)]
    REVIEW[同源管理页 GET/POST
明确确认排除/撤销/清空]
    SELECT[selectionInterests
14 天候选 / 30 天排除 / 每三天最多一槽]
    PROMPT[原 promptFor 选片搜索
仍由现有只读权限控制]
    WATCH -->|安全陌生主题| STATE
    REVIEW -->|仅改变短期好奇状态| STATE
    STATE --> SELECT
    SELECT --> PROMPT
  end
